# 🤖 Local AI Chatbot

A conversational AI chatbot built with **Python**, **Streamlit**, and the **OpenAI API**. This project provides a simple ChatGPT-style interface that runs locally in a web browser while communicating securely with OpenAI's language models.

The application demonstrates how to build an AI-powered web application using Python, manage API credentials securely with environment variables, and maintain conversation history across multiple chat sessions.

---

## Features

- ChatGPT-style conversational interface
- Multiple saved conversations
- Sidebar navigation for previous chats
- Persistent chat history stored locally
- Streamlit web interface
- OpenAI API integration
- Secure API key management using environment variables
- Virtual environment support (.venv)

---

