## Installation

### Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/dreevesjr1/local-ai-chatbot.git

cd local-ai-chatbot
```

---

### Create a virtual environment

Windows

```powershell
python -m venv .venv
```

Activate the virtual environment

```powershell
.venv\Scripts\activate
```

---

### Install dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

### Configure the OpenAI API Key

Sign into OpenAI https://auth.openai.com/log-in

Select API Keys in the left

Select +Create new secret key in the top right corner

Give it a name, the name is only important for OpenAI profile

Save the API KEY created in a text document

PowerShell

```powershell
$env:OPENAI_API_KEY="YOUR_API_KEY"
```

Never place your API key directly inside your source code.

---

## Running the Application

```bash
python -m streamlit run chatbot.py
```

Open your browser to

```
http://localhost:8501
```

